flowchart TB
    U[User question] --> G[Advice guard]
    G -->|in scope| MEM
    G -->|advice| R[Refuse]
    MEM[Memory node<br/>resolve question · parse explicit preferences] -->|resolved question| S

    subgraph S[Supervisor]
        P[Plan or replan<br/>max 3 hops<br/>max 1 replan<br/>projected cost cap]
        D[Dispatch next specialist]
        A[Draft from typed evidence]
        V{Verifier gate}
        P --> D
        A --> V
        V -->|reject, one retry| A
    end

    D --> F
    D --> E
    D --> M
    subgraph F[Forecast sub-agent]
        FT[get_forecast<br/>compare_models]
    end
    subgraph E[Event-effect sub-agent]
        ET[event_effect]
    end
    subgraph M[FOMC retrieval sub-agent]
        MT[search_fomc]
    end
    FT --> H[Typed Handoff<br/>task · inputs · evidence · status · cost]
    ET --> H
    MT --> H
    H -->|dispatch · replan · draft| S
    V -->|verified| O[Answer]
    V -->|exhausted / cannot verify| R

    CP[(SQLite checkpointer<br/>thread turns and preferences)] -.-> S
    LS[(SQLite preference store<br/>user defaults)] -.->|session read · explicit write| MEM

    classDef default font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
